{
    "title": "Prison Angels : Sin City",
    "description": "STORYLINE\uff1a\r\nAfter Victor, the son of the Mafia Boss, was arrested for robbery, he was not quickly bailed out as usual. His fianc\u00e9e also demanded to cancel the engagement. He was subjected to multiple assassination attempts in prison until a mysterious person appeared, and a conspiracy gradually came to light.\r\n\r\nFEATURES\uff1a\r\nWhat can you experience in Prison Angels?\r\nPOWER\r\nHere, you can recruit many distinct and diverse characters from the four major factions. Command the arrogant street gangs, bribe the greedy harbor police, unite with the proud family council, and collaborate with the cunning smuggling syndicate. However, you must be careful, as surviving in the chaotic 'Angel's Bay' is never easy.\r\n\r\nDESIRE\r\nIn the 'Angel's Bay' prison that you manage, various types of 'Prison Angels' are detained. As the warden, you can interrogate them, and how you do it is entirely up to your preferences.\r\n\r\nTHRILL\r\nA prison-themed RPG game that is completely different from the existing crime games on the market. Here, you can experience completely different ways of escaping. With a rich variety of battle scenes, including the prison, the streets, the waterfront, the bar, the factory, and more, each character has their own exclusive deadly skill. The rich skill effects will truly shock your eyes.\r\n\r\nWISDOM\r\nThis seemingly simple puzzle game actually requires a combination of intelligence and luck to complete each level perfectly. In addition to experiencing the joy of the game, you can also have some fun challenges.\r\n\r\nWEALTH\r\nCollect treasure chests while AFK, easily cultivate your characters with one click, and achieve powerful combat power in your spare time. Get free gifts and rewards, with various gameplays available, playing without any stress or pressure, and accumulating wealth easily.\r\n\r\nYouTube\uff1ahttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCv3S0eFr7oKTYRDqcc8Hg7Q\r\nfacebook\uff1ahttps://www.facebook.com/prisonangelsofficial\r\nTwitter\uff1ahttps://twitter.com/Prison_Angels\r\nInstagram\uff1ahttps://www.instagram.com/prison.angels/\r\nReddit\uff1ahttps://www.reddit.com/r/PrisonAngels/\r\nDiscord\uff1ahttps://discord.gg/GECQvjNbXW",
    "descriptionHTML": "STORYLINE\uff1a<br>After Victor, the son of the Mafia Boss, was arrested for robbery, he was not quickly bailed out as usual. His fianc\u00e9e also demanded to cancel the engagement. He was subjected to multiple assassination attempts in prison until a mysterious person appeared, and a conspiracy gradually came to light.<br><br>FEATURES\uff1a<br>What can you experience in Prison Angels?<br>POWER<br>Here, you can recruit many distinct and diverse characters from the four major factions. Command the arrogant street gangs, bribe the greedy harbor police, unite with the proud family council, and collaborate with the cunning smuggling syndicate. However, you must be careful, as surviving in the chaotic &#39;Angel&#39;s Bay&#39; is never easy.<br><br>DESIRE<br>In the &#39;Angel&#39;s Bay&#39; prison that you manage, various types of &#39;Prison Angels&#39; are detained. As the warden, you can interrogate them, and how you do it is entirely up to your preferences.<br><br>THRILL<br>A prison-themed RPG game that is completely different from the existing crime games on the market. Here, you can experience completely different ways of escaping. With a rich variety of battle scenes, including the prison, the streets, the waterfront, the bar, the factory, and more, each character has their own exclusive deadly skill. The rich skill effects will truly shock your eyes.<br><br>WISDOM<br>This seemingly simple puzzle game actually requires a combination of intelligence and luck to complete each level perfectly. In addition to experiencing the joy of the game, you can also have some fun challenges.<br><br>WEALTH<br>Collect treasure chests while AFK, easily cultivate your characters with one click, and achieve powerful combat power in your spare time. Get free gifts and rewards, with various gameplays available, playing without any stress or pressure, and accumulating wealth easily.<br><br>YouTube\uff1ahttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCv3S0eFr7oKTYRDqcc8Hg7Q<br>